      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1786473825448,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "REQUIREMENTS\n\n• 1s GPU telemetry\n• 30s rollups\n• 3-month trend dashboards\n• Per-GPU per-second drilldown\n• Late/out-of-order tolerant\n• Durable + replayable\n• Multi-tenant RBAC\n• Guarded NL→SQL\n• Cost + query limits\n• Operable at fleet scale",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "r2",
      "originalText": "REQUIREMENTS\n\n• 1s GPU telemetry\n• 30s rollups\n• 3-month trend dashboards\n• Per-GPU per-second drilldown\n• Late/out-of-order tolerant\n• Durable + replayable\n• Multi-tenant RBAC\n• Guarded NL→SQL\n• Cost + query limits\n• Operable at fleet scale",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
