      "updated": 1786473851752,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "\n  CORE ENTITIES\n\n1) GpuTelemetry\ntenantId / clusterId / hostId / gpuId\nmetric / value / unit\neventTime / ingestTime / sequence\nschemaVersion / workloadId / collectorId\n\n2) MetricDefinition\ntype / unit / legal rollup\n\n3) TelemetryGap\nexpected / received / reason",
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "r4",
      "originalText": "\n  CORE ENTITIES\n\n1) GpuTelemetry\ntenantId / clusterId / hostId / gpuId\nmetric / value / unit\neventTime / ingestTime / sequence\nschemaVersion / workloadId / collectorId\n\n2) MetricDefinition\ntype / unit / legal rollup\n\n3) TelemetryGap\nexpected / received / reason",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
