      "seed": 1650772337,
      "version": 115,
      "versionNonce": 1092853398,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1786474186530,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "DESIGN PRINCIPLES\n\n• At-least-once + deterministic dedup\n• Event time + ingest time\n• Local WAL (Write-ahead log) on every host\n• Durable event log as buffer/replay\n• Hot OLAP + cold lake\n• Precompute long-range rollups\n• Raw 1s only where needed\n• Authorization outside the LLM\n• SQL parsed/rewritten, never trusted",
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "r6",
      "originalText": "DESIGN PRINCIPLES\n\n• At-least-once + deterministic dedup\n• Event time + ingest time\n• Local WAL (Write-ahead log) on every host\n• Durable event log as buffer/replay\n• Hot OLAP + cold lake\n• Precompute long-range rollups\n• Raw 1s only where needed\n• Authorization outside the LLM\n• SQL parsed/rewritten, never trusted",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
