      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1786473760368,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "IF 1s DATA = 1 YEAR\n\n• Do not keep all hot\n• Hot 7–30d\n• Warm 30–90d\n• Cold lake 1y\n• Predicate pushdown\n• Column pruning\n• Compression / compaction\n• Query older data through lake engine",
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "r76",
      "originalText": "IF 1s DATA = 1 YEAR\n\n• Do not keep all hot\n• Hot 7–30d\n• Warm 30–90d\n• Cold lake 1y\n• Predicate pushdown\n• Column pruning\n• Compression / compaction\n• Query older data through lake engine",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
